Intended use
------------
This map is intended to use with water O (smiles notation). It can be applied both for H2O and HOD, but gives the frequency of the OH stretch.

How to use
----------
This map should be used with the WaterCoupling map, which will provide the related couplings repending ohe system.


Available parameters
--------------------
At this point the frequency map has no options or parameters. See the WaterCoupling map for the parameters related to the coupling.

Warnings that can be raised by this map
---------------------------------------
At this point none
